00:33:21.264 --> 00:33:25.120
- I think that being involved
in activities like this

00:33:25.120 --> 00:33:27.520
only enhances your education.

00:33:27.520 --> 00:33:30.190
I think it's
important while you're

00:33:30.190 --> 00:33:34.460
at school to focus on things
besides your own research.

00:33:34.460 --> 00:33:38.290
- So people come here as
scientists, as engineers,

00:33:38.290 --> 00:33:41.380
as mathematicians, but
when they are making art,

00:33:41.380 --> 00:33:43.258
