00:33:45.892 --> 00:33:48.048
Because of the
color of their skin.

00:33:48.048 --> 00:33:50.443
Ball of confusion.

00:33:50.443 --> 00:33:55.670
- I think that it's
a way of chilling out

00:33:55.670 --> 00:33:57.660
