00:40:31.421 --> 00:40:32.420
KEYSER: You know what?

00:40:32.420 --> 00:40:33.130
I'm working now.

00:40:33.130 --> 00:40:34.040
You can't talk to me.

00:40:34.040 --> 00:40:35.379
I'm supposed to be working.

00:40:35.379 --> 00:40:36.170
Wait just a second.

00:40:36.170 --> 00:40:38.767
For God's sake.

00:40:38.767 --> 00:40:39.350
Don't go away.

00:40:39.350 --> 00:40:41.300
I'll be right with you.

00:40:41.300 --> 00:40:43.550
I've got an interesting
