04:47:38.630 --> 04:47:40.340
D'ARBELOFF: It is
now my pleasure

04:47:40.340 --> 04:47:44.780
to introduce James A. Lash,
the Chief Marshal, who

04:47:44.780 --> 04:47:46.850
will greet the graduates.

04:47:46.850 --> 04:47:51.410
Mr. Lash a member
of the Class of 1966

04:47:51.410 --> 04:47:55.318
